  "user_request_original": "Execute a deterministic TMM optimization for a planar three-medium stack: Incident Air (n=1.0), Layer 1 (SiO2, n=1.46, lossless), Layer 2 (TiO2, n=2.40, lossless), Substrate Glass (n=1.52, lossless). Optimize the thickness of Layer 1 and Layer 2 to minimize the arithmetic mean power reflectance for s-polarized light at normal incidence over the wavelength range 450 nm to 700 nm (5 nm spacing). Constraints: Thickness of Layer 1 in [40, 160] nm; Thickness of Layer 2 in [40, 160] nm. Use seed 17 for the optimizer. Maximum 64 solver evaluations. Report the optimal thicknesses, the full reflectance spectrum, and the calculated mean reflectance. Canonical user controls: incidence angles 0 degrees. polarization s. wavelength intervals 450-700 nm. soft objectives: minimize arithmetic mean power reflectance from 450 nm to 700 nm; achieve mean reflectance below 0.03 as a soft scoring preference. behaviors to suppress or avoid: high reflection in the 450 nm to 700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: layer thickness must be between 40 nm and 160 nm; exactly one layer of SiO2 and one layer of TiO2.",
